cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Thirteen Mission Waypoint Drone Survey | Plymouth, Minnesota, USA"
abstract: >-
  A complete drone photogrammetry image set of a residential complex in Plymouth, Minnesota,
  captured October 22, 2026 with a DJI FC9313 at native 4096x3072 resolution, as 13 waypoint
  missions planned in QGIS: two crosshatched nadir grids at 60 m, one large orbit at 60 m and
  ten small orbits at 40 m, flown on four batteries. 1,421 images, all camera originals, GPS
  intact on every frame, original aircraft filenames preserved, each image tagged with its
  mission. 1,414 solve in one component; solved camera poses for the original photos in COLMAP
  (FULL_OPENCV, one camera per photo) and RealityScan XMP formats and 3.9 million tie points are
  included, in a metric frame fitted to the photos' GPS. There is no physical scale reference.
authors:
  - family-names: Guertin
    given-names: Matthew
    website: "https://mattguertin.com"
date-released: 2026-10-23
version: "1.0.0"
